{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2235","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2235","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2235\",\"parent_revision\":\"40f5a9defefa32ce53dcfeb3bf73b6a459ad2b8434f3bd35c7ebde763f54b091\",\"root_revision\":\"40f5a9defefa32ce53dcfeb3bf73b6a459ad2b8434f3bd35c7ebde763f54b091\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThe summarizer SubagentStop hook fires on every agent session, not just summarizer agents. When `agent_type` is not one of `file-summarizer`, `url-summarizer`, or `image-summarizer`, the hook's own Step 1 instructs it to output `{}` and stop. Instead, the hook is outputting a long natural-language explanation of why the condition is not satisfied.\\n\\nObserved behavior: Three consecutive stop-hook feedback messages were emitted during a `dh:backlog-item-groomer` session, each containing the full hook prompt text plus a verbose Step 1 failure explanation.\\n\\nExpected behavior: When `agent_type` does not match the summarizer domain, the hook outputs `{}` with no feedback text and no further processing.\\n\\nRoot cause hypothesis: The hook prompt uses a conditional instruction (\\\"Output exactly: {} \u2192 Stop\\\") but the model running the hook is treating the instruction as a reasoning step to narrate rather than a terminal output action.\\n\\nFix options:\\n1. Add a `condition` field to the hook registration in `hooks.json` that filters by `agent_type` so the hook script is never invoked for non-summarizer agents \u2014 avoids the model entirely for out-of-scope calls.\\n2. Harden the hook prompt so Step 1 is an unambiguous output-and-halt with no room for narration (e.g., reframe as a JSON decision tree rather than prose instructions).\\n\\nImpact: Noise in every non-summarizer agent session. Three identical feedback messages appeared in a single grooming session.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **summarizer stop-hook emits verbose feedback text on non-summarizer agents instead of silent {}** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Observed during dh:backlog-item-groomer session for issue #2183, 2026-05-09\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-05-09\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"a91bd8ed94e6a4e7d587f3ac5c0912b81dbd08fdac923b86759518eed8b989a9\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVCUZAQ\"}"}